                  "targets": {
                    "value": ""
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "value": "When you Cast this Spell, roll 1d20 and make a note of the result. You gain the following reaction; once you use the reaction, the spell ends, and you become temporarily immune to _lucky number_ until the next time you make your daily preparations.\n\n**That's My Number!**\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Traits:** divination, fortune\n- **Trigger:** You roll your lucky number as your d20 result on a non-secret attack roll, saving throw, or skill check\n\nYou call upon the fortune stored within your lucky number and reroll the triggering check. However, pushing your luck has a price: if your result on the reroll is the same number again, you critically fail, regardless of what degree of success you ordinarily would have received."
